{
 "encounter_id": "00934",
 "speakers": {
  "person_1": "PATIENT",
  "person_2": "DOCTOR"
 },
 "turns": [
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Hello, doctor! I've had psoriasis for years, but now my joints are hurting, and my nails look terrible. I thought it was time to come in."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Good to meet you. Tell me about the joints first. Which ones?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Mainly my fingers, and my right knee. They're stiff and swollen."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "When are they worst?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "In the morning. It takes me a good hour to get going."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "How long has this been happening?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "About four months. It started slowly."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "And the nails?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "They're pitted, little dents, and a couple of them have come away from the nail bed."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any eye redness or pain, or back pain at night?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No. Not that I've noticed."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "What do you use for the psoriasis?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "A steroid cream on my elbows, calcipotriol, once a day."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Do you take anything for the joint pain? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Just ibuprofen, 400 mg, when it's bad."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any other conditions?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Psoriasis since I was twenty. That's all."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Does psoriasis or arthritis run in the family? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "My father had psoriasis. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Do you smoke, or drink alcohol?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "I smoke ten a day. I'd like to cut down."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Let me check your blood pressure and pulse. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Go on.",
   "pause": 10.0
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Blood pressure 126 over 80, pulse 72, temperature 36.6."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Normal? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Normal. Now let me look at your hands and your knee. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Of course.",
   "pause": 18.0
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "There's swelling and tenderness in several finger joints, and the nails are pitted with lifting. The right knee has a small effusion."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "What does that mean? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "It strongly suggests psoriatic arthritis, and the nail changes support it. I'd also like blood tests and X-rays of your hands."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Is it serious? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "It can damage joints if it is not treated, so early treatment is important. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "What treatment? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "There are several options, and I'd like a rheumatologist to guide it. I'll refer you urgently, and in the meantime take naproxen, 500 mg, twice a day with food."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "All right. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "And it would help your joints and skin to stop smoking. I can help you with that."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "I'd like that. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "I'll see you in four weeks, once the tests are back."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Thank you, doctor. ~"
  }
 ],
